\ Third module for nested_quotation_capture_tail_call.1z. A word here is in neither the driver's
\ module nor the one that builds the quotation, so a tail call into it changes module.

apply-quot: ( q -- x ) [ call ] ;

\ Binds a local of its own before invoking, so the callee's own lexical frame is live at the moment
\ the passed quotation pushes its nested body.
apply-quot-over-local: ( q -- x ) [ bias: 0 ; call bias + ] ;
